{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/c422651e51a51c5f285f54e30fc85e64.avif?t=1755192548\" width=856 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/3326d74e8810a022836b27595e75269c.poster.avif?t=1755192548\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/3326d74e8810a022836b27595e75269c.webm?t=1755192548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/3326d74e8810a022836b27595e75269c.mp4?t=1755192548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a canoe and control it at the same time. SHOUT, PANIC, MISCOMMUNICATE, OVERSTEER, and somehow still move forward, together. The ultimate test for your friendship is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/05c04daf3d4318f879aeab3993d75ebf.avif?t=1755192548\" width=856 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/23f42cdbb8e08c85144f176bcd284942.poster.avif?t=1755192548\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/23f42cdbb8e08c85144f176bcd284942.webm?t=1755192548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/23f42cdbb8e08c85144f176bcd284942.mp4?t=1755192548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a peaceful river ride. It\u2019s physics-based multiplayer MADNESS where every second counts. HIT every rock, SCREAM through every turn, and FLIP OVER when it matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/9c188446f35f5367ac4534ccd1ca119c.avif?t=1755192548\" width=856 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/c8f7f970243578c8072618633de71989.poster.avif?t=1755192548\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/c8f7f970243578c8072618633de71989.webm?t=1755192548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/c8f7f970243578c8072618633de71989.mp4?t=1755192548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, there\u2019s a baby. And yes, YOU ARE RESPONSIBLE. Paddle through rapids, rocks, and sheer panic while desperately trying not to flip the boat and launch the poor thing into oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/c1dc9a254def1f5305e5c7da4f30fa4a.avif?t=1755192548\" width=856 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/a3944ae32ae890e7470e4740e466a881.poster.avif?t=1755192548\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/a3944ae32ae890e7470e4740e466a881.webm?t=1755192548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/a3944ae32ae890e7470e4740e466a881.mp4?t=1755192548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome wildly different challenges, dodge unpredictable obstacles, and try to finish the course without flying, falling, or fully losing your mind. Be warned: every turn hides a new surprise and YOU ARE ABSOLUTELY NOT READY FOR IT.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845160?t=1755192548","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845160?t=1755192548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/96d7569cc67044d0293139934ed2a4e9287cd35f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755192548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/96d7569cc67044d0293139934ed2a4e9287cd35f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755192548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845160/extras/c422651e51a51c5f285f54e30fc85e64.avif?t=1755192